{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "reviewedAt": "2026-11-15",
  "title": "Additional editorial display rules for misleading labels around 1200",
  "input": {
    "dataset": "Cliopatria v0.2.1",
    "sourceCommit": "5f433377139a6eeaeacbdc894b70f8805b72c8b5",
    "geometryModified": false
  },
  "intervalSemantics": "Both endpoints inclusive. Rule dates are display applicability, not automatically lifespans. Historical event years are discussed separately.",
  "applicationOrder": [
    "Select source records with fromYear <= chosenYear <= toYear.",
    "Apply existing corrections and these exactOriginal rules. Hide only matching records in the stated year range.",
    "Retain original, source date range, geometry and sourceRecords. Store nameZh as a display override for rename rules.",
    "Compute parent names from the remaining records, using exact originals. Then suppress children whose stated parent actually remains.",
    "A missing polygon is missing or withheld evidence; do not repaint it as a modern country or an assumed successor."
  ],
  "rules": [
    {
      "id": "great-seljuk-overrun",
      "exactOriginal": [
        "Great Seljuk Empire"
      ],
      "fromYear": 1195,
      "toYear": 2024,
      "action": "hide",
      "basis": "documented-latest-end",
      "historicalEndYear": 1194,
      "reason": "源记录延续到 1201 年，超过伊朗、伊拉克塞尔柱政权最晚的 1194 年终点；仅隐藏这个原名，保留鲁姆苏丹国。",
      "sources": [
        "iranica-isfahan-1194"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "hamdanid-overrun",
      "exactOriginal": [
        "Hamdanid Emirates"
      ],
      "fromYear": 1005,
      "toYear": 2024,
      "action": "hide",
      "basis": "documented-latest-end",
      "historicalEndYear": 1004,
      "reason": "原始记录链接的是叙利亚和北美索不达米亚的 Hamdanid dynasty（Wikidata Q837187），不是也门同名王朝；源记录延续到 1249 年，1004 年后不应继续填作哈姆丹政权。",
      "sources": [
        "getty-hamdanid",
        "met-islamic-rulers"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "viking-settlement-category",
      "exactOriginal": [
        "Viking settlements"
      ],
      "fromYear": 793,
      "toYear": 1332,
      "action": "hide",
      "basis": "political-layer-selection",
      "reason": "这是横跨多个地区的北欧人聚居分布，不是同一统治机构的领土。在政权填色层排除；可在未来有独立图例和考古证据的聚居层呈现。不声称这些聚落在 1066 年消失。",
      "sources": [
        "vikings-scotland-museum"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "brythonic-aggregate-high-medieval",
      "exactOriginal": [
        "(Brythonic Kingdoms)"
      ],
      "fromYear": 1000,
      "toYear": 1284,
      "action": "hide",
      "basis": "political-layer-selection",
      "reason": "文化和语言关系的汇总层不作为一个统一王国。先隐藏此汇总项，再依据剩余原名计算父子遮蔽，恢复源数据中的 Gwynedd、Powys 等真实命名政权。1000 是本项核验的展示范围起点，不是某国灭亡年。",
      "sources": [
        "cadw-medieval-wales",
        "cambridge-british-contexts"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "brythons-high-medieval",
      "exactOriginal": [
        "Brythons"
      ],
      "fromYear": 1000,
      "toYear": 1235,
      "action": "hide",
      "basis": "unresolved-ethnonym-in-political-layer",
      "reason": "本名为布立吞人的族群类称谓。1200 年记录包含威尔士及更北区域，缺乏可据以改成一个具体国家的对应关系，故从本次核验的高、中晚期中世纪政权层排除。此规则既非族群消亡断言，也不认证 1000 年之前的多边形。",
      "sources": [
        "cadw-medieval-wales",
        "cambridge-british-contexts"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "halych-occupation-quarantine",
      "exactOriginal": [
        "Halych-Volhynia occupation"
      ],
      "fromYear": 1056,
      "toYear": 1240,
      "action": "hide",
      "basis": "unverified-occupation-extent",
      "reason": "联合公国建于 1199 年；源数据却从 1056 年起使用这一占领区名称，且 1200 年多边形远伸至黑海草原。本次没有找到能验证这一具体范围与区间的权威边界来源。隔离这组记录，不把它直接改名为联合公国，也不以现代国界或推测补齐空白。",
      "sources": [
        "ieu-galicia-volhynia"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "serbia-pre-kingdom-title",
      "exactOriginal": [
        "Kingdom of Serbia"
      ],
      "fromYear": 1188,
      "toYear": 1216,
      "action": "rename",
      "nameZh": "塞尔维亚大公国（拉什卡）",
      "nameEn": "Grand Principality of Serbia (Rascia)",
      "basis": "documented-title-change",
      "reason": "1217 年王冠加冕前不能称塞尔维亚王国。保留原始几何和 original，不提前王国称号；现代塞尔维亚王国的同名记录不受影响。",
      "sources": [
        "kalic-serbia-coronation",
        "serbian-academy-chronology"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "halych-union-label-1200",
      "exactOriginal": [
        "Principality of Halych"
      ],
      "fromYear": 1200,
      "toYear": 1201,
      "action": "rename",
      "nameZh": "加利奇—沃里尼亚公国·加利奇",
      "nameEn": "Galicia-Volhynia (Halych component)",
      "basis": "documented-union-label",
      "reason": "1199 年后已由罗曼联合统治。仅把 1200–1201 年原有几何标为联合公国的组成区域，不声称两个独立国家；1202 年起源数据已有 Principality of Galicia-Volhynia。未将其几何倒推至 1199 年。",
      "sources": [
        "ieu-galicia-volhynia"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "volhynia-union-label-1200",
      "exactOriginal": [
        "Principality of Volhynia"
      ],
      "fromYear": 1200,
      "toYear": 1201,
      "action": "rename",
      "nameZh": "加利奇—沃里尼亚公国·沃里尼亚",
      "nameEn": "Galicia-Volhynia (Volhynia component)",
      "basis": "documented-union-label",
      "reason": "1199 年后已由罗曼联合统治。只作区域名称注记；不修改、不合并、不补画原始多边形。",
      "sources": [
        "ieu-galicia-volhynia"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "transitionYearNotes": [
    {
      "year": 1004,
      "original": "Hamdanid Emirates",
      "note": "终结事件发生在该年；本硬性尾部过滤从 1005 年开始。"
    },
    {
      "year": 1194,
      "original": "Great Seljuk Empire",
      "note": "图格里勒于该年 3 月战死；年内早期与晚期情况不同。硬性尾部过滤从 1195 年开始。"
    },
    {
      "year": 1199,
      "originals": [
        "Principality of Halych",
        "Principality of Volhynia"
      ],
      "note": "该年发生联合。本补丁只为明确在联合之后的 1200–1201 年更改区域注记；1199 年需要事件日期或年内状态说明。"
    },
    {
      "year": 1217,
      "original": "Kingdom of Serbia",
      "note": "该年发生王冠加冕；1217 年以前不显示王国称号，不能推断 1217 年 1 月 1 日已经加冕。"
    }
  ],
  "limits": [
    "This is a bounded label/time audit, not a validation of every Cliopatria boundary.",
    "The 1158–1194 Great Seljuk label can conflate successor branches; this patch only removes the incontrovertible post-1194 tail and does not certify the earlier geometry.",
    "Brythons and Brythonic Kingdoms rules beginning in 1000 are a political-layer selection within the reviewed period, not historical extinction dates. Earlier records remain outside this audit.",
    "The Viking and Halych occupation removals are category/verification decisions, not claims that Norse communities or all Galician-Volhynian campaigns were absent.",
    "Retained Gwynedd/Powys/Rum and Galicia-Volhynia component polygons are existing source records; this audit does not independently certify their exact borders."
  ],
